    "The Corruption Eradication Commission is investigating container seizures at Tanjung Emas Port.",
    "The head of Tanjung Emas Customs has been called in for questioning as part of the ongoing probe.",
    "This follows previous corruption convictions involving senior customs leadership regarding import bribery."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Corruption Eradication Commission (KPK) is currently conducting an investigation into irregularities involving the seizure of shipping containers at Tanjung Emas Port. As part of these efforts, investigators have summoned the head of Tanjung Emas Customs for questioning. This inquiry occurs amid heightened scrutiny of the customs department, which has recently faced legal challenges including the conviction of a former director on corruption charges related to import bribery. Simultaneously, various regional customs offices across Indonesia have reported increased enforcement activities, focusing on the seizure of illegal cigarettes, illicit alcohol, and narcotics. While regional branches continue to implement new service standards and conduct local enforcement operations, the central investigation at Tanjung Emas represents a significant ongoing effort by the KPK to address institutional corruption concerns within the agency.",
